:seed: filing-spine-303-ledger
@step Create the declaration so its reference number exists.
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 303 --year 2026 --period 1T
@capture work_unit_id result.work_unit_id
@step Show the declaration status by its reference number.
aeat app modelo work status {work_unit_id}
@step Calculate by the same reference number.
aeat app modelo work calculate {work_unit_id} --no-joint-return-elected
@step List the saved calculations by the same reference number.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work revisions {work_unit_id}
@expect result.revision_count == 1
@expect exit_code == 0
